From 55a5d1612186399833382aab88b0f2804412db45 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 03:26:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(kanban): linked-card rows and card reads carry
 ready_since for the wait-for-worker age [daveey]

The session panel says a ready card is 'waiting for a worker' but not for how long. Local session_tasks rows,
replica rows (replica_cards) and GET /tasks/:id now carry the Board-synced tasks.ready_since (ms); boards
without the column read None.
---
